		<div class="fl-builder-content fl-builder-content-764 fl-builder-global-templates-locked" data-post-id="764"><div class="fl-row fl-row-full-width fl-row-bg-photo fl-node-4rmcfj57nsov fl-row-default-height fl-row-align-center section-banner" data-node="4rmcfj57nsov">
	<div class="fl-row-content-wrap">
								<div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width fl-node-content">
		
<div class="fl-col-group fl-node-do3016g7x49v" data-node="do3016g7x49v">
			<div class="fl-col fl-node-nz8kermd590f fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="nz8kermd590f">
	<div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><div class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-node-45q3zg2jr7e8" data-node="45q3zg2jr7e8">
	<div class="fl-module-content fl-node-content">
		<h1 class="fl-heading">
		<span class="fl-heading-text">Bible In A Year Devotional | Volume 4</span>
	</h1>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
			<div class="fl-col fl-node-xu05zvpm3bch fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="xu05zvpm3bch">
	<div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"></div>
</div>
	</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="fl-row fl-row-full-width fl-row-bg-none fl-node-r4ek1ungd82a fl-row-default-height fl-row-align-center" data-node="r4ek1ungd82a">
	<div class="fl-row-content-wrap">
								<div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width fl-node-content">
		
<div class="fl-col-group fl-node-urpscltebfwq" data-node="urpscltebfwq">
			<div class="fl-col fl-node-hu32acb51frt fl-col-bg-color" data-node="hu32acb51frt">
	<div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><div class="fl-module fl-module-fl-post-content fl-node-63wgd7t5svql" data-node="63wgd7t5svql">
	<div class="fl-module-content fl-node-content">
		
<p><strong><em>The final chapter of our journey through God’s Word begins</em></strong>!</p>



<p>Let&#8217;s continue journeying through Scripture with daily readings from both the Old and New Testaments, accompanied by reflections based on our 4 mission pillars. As we reach the final volume, reflect on how God has spoken, shaped and grown us through His Word throughout the year!</p>



<p>Whether you’ve stayed consistent, fallen behind, or are just picking up the devotional again, <strong>it’s never too late to return to God’s Word.</strong> We&#8217;re not simply to completing a reading plan, but to cultivating a life rooted in Scripture, prayer and a growing relationship with Jesus.</p>



<p>As we close the year, let’s finish strong together and give thanks for all that God has done in us through His Word!</p>



<div data-wp-interactive="core/file" class="wp-block-file"><object data-wp-bind--hidden="!state.hasPdfPreview" hidden class="wp-block-file__embed" data="https://lighthouse.org.sg/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/biay-volume-4-full-version.pdf" type="application/pdf" style="width:100%;height:600px" aria-label="Embed of BIAY VOLUME 4 FULL VERSION."></object><a id="wp-block-file--media-7e3b37e4-5306-4864-ae44-28ad85d82151" href="https://lighthouse.org.sg/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/biay-volume-4-full-version.pdf">BIAY VOLUME 4 FULL VERSION</a><a href="https://lighthouse.org.sg/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/biay-volume-4-full-version.pdf" class="wp-block-file__button wp-element-button" download aria-describedby="wp-block-file--media-7e3b37e4-5306-4864-ae44-28ad85d82151">Download</a></div>



<p></p>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
			<div class="fl-col fl-node-2yq5oslaurkf fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small col-daily-meditation" data-node="2yq5oslaurkf">
